    [Database] Which database should the billing service use in production?
      1. PostgreSQL with logical replication to the analytics warehouse
         A managed server; the team already runs two clusters, so on-call knows it, but it adds a network hop to every
         request.
      2. SQLite
         Embedded, zero-ops, one file per tenant; replication would need Litestream or similar tooling.
